WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.998 --> 00:00:18.959
The Rocket Girl clone shot toward Roxy.

2
00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:21.701
Roxy leaped out of the way.

3
00:00:22.561 --> 00:00:24.662
She fired her eye laser beams at the clone.

4
00:00:25.282 --> 00:00:28.864
Whiz-hoo! The clone jumped, but it was too slow.

5
00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.681
Its foot smoked where the laser had hit it.

6
00:00:34.662 --> 00:00:37.024
The clone glanced at its foot and then flew away.

7
00:00:37.944 --> 00:00:39.045
Roxy shot after it.

8
00:00:40.466 --> 00:00:42.687
Roxy's friends were at the lake in Metro City Park.

9
00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:45.509
Mara and Jack were looking at a turtle.

10
00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:47.250
Terrell looked up.

11
00:00:48.271 --> 00:00:51.293
Zoom! The Rocket Girl clone flew past.

12
00:00:52.134 --> 00:00:56.597
Zoom! Roxy flew past, shooting lasers at the clone.

13
00:00:56.617 --> 00:01:01.260
"Whoa! Two Rocket Girls!"

14
00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:02.340
cried Terrell.

15
00:01:03.381 --> 00:01:04.561
Mara and Jack looked up.

16
00:01:04.581 --> 00:01:07.122
"Where?" asked Mara.

17
00:01:08.202 --> 00:01:10.322
"They're gone now," said Terrell.

18
00:01:11.003 --> 00:01:13.143
Jack and Mara both gave Terrell a funny look.

19
00:01:17.064 --> 00:01:19.805
The Professor Ditto clones were arguing and yelling in the lab.

20
00:01:19.825 --> 00:01:23.226
"It's not my fault Rocket Girl escaped!"

21
00:01:23.466 --> 00:01:23.926
said one.

22
00:01:23.946 --> 00:01:27.227
"It was your idea to lock her in that room!"

23
00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:28.047
said another.

24
00:01:28.067 --> 00:01:31.884
"I wanted to lock her in the—" Ka-boom!

25
00:01:32.705 --> 00:01:33.806
The wall blew apart.

26
00:01:34.746 --> 00:01:37.047
The Rocket Girl clone crashed onto the floor.

27
00:01:38.168 --> 00:01:39.349
Roxy flew in after it.

28
00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:44.132
The Professor Dittos looked at the broken Rocket Girl clone.

29
00:01:45.132 --> 00:01:46.093
They looked at Roxy.

30
00:01:46.113 --> 00:01:47.814
"Get her!"

31
00:01:48.114 --> 00:01:48.654
yelled one.

32
00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:51.516
The professors rushed toward Roxy.

33
00:01:52.416 --> 00:01:55.738
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's lasers hit one professor.

34
00:01:57.059 --> 00:01:58.180
Smoke came from his ears.

35
00:01:59.232 --> 00:02:01.893
"Which one of you is the real Professor Ditto?"

36
00:02:02.153 --> 00:02:02.833
yelled Roxy.

37
00:02:03.773 --> 00:02:05.074
The professors all answered.

38
00:02:05.094 --> 00:02:07.834
"I am."

39
00:02:09.495 --> 00:02:12.055
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired again.

40
00:02:13.096 --> 00:02:14.676
The professors jumped out of the way.

41
00:02:15.676 --> 00:02:17.177
Roxy's lasers hit the computer.

42
00:02:17.197 --> 00:02:22.218
Boom! Fzzt!

43
00:02:22.498 --> 00:02:25.799
Fzzt! All the clones sparked and smoked.

44
00:02:27.099 --> 00:02:28.640
"Oh said Roxy.

45
00:02:29.172 --> 00:02:32.013
"Without the computer, the clones are breaking down!

46
00:02:33.114 --> 00:02:35.915
Soon I'll find out which one is the real Professor Ditto."

47
00:02:36.976 --> 00:02:40.097
One by one, the clones fell over until none were standing.

48
00:02:40.998 --> 00:02:41.978
Roxy was shocked.

49
00:02:43.199 --> 00:02:45.180
"Where's the real Professor Ditto?"

50
00:02:47.821 --> 00:02:49.842
A month later the new playground was finished.

51
00:02:50.942 --> 00:02:54.064
At the opening ceremony, Roxy looked at the crowd and gasped.

52
00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.141
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy whispered.

53
00:03:03.161 --> 00:03:10.143
"That's—" "The real Professor Ditto," said the mayor.

54
00:03:10.163 --> 00:03:14.404
"He retired from Metro City University ten years ago.

55
00:03:15.525 --> 00:03:18.445
He felt bad that the clones he invented were causing trouble.

56
00:03:19.426 --> 00:03:22.207
So he donated money to help build the new playground."

57
00:03:23.607 --> 00:03:25.348
"This playground is awesome!"

58
00:03:25.708 --> 00:03:26.288
said Jack.

59
00:03:27.712 --> 00:03:31.397
"I wonder if the two Rocket Girls helped to build it," said Terrell.

60
00:03:32.438 --> 00:03:33.219
Mara laughed.

61
00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:36.784
"There's only one Rocket Girl."

62
00:03:36.804 --> 00:03:38.786
"I saw two!"

63
00:03:39.227 --> 00:03:40.708
said Terrell, looking annoyed.

64
00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:42.631
Roxy smiled.

65
00:03:42.651 --> 00:03:44.713
"I believe you, Terrell."
